---
import Cta from "./Cta.astro";
import { site, github } from "../site.config";
---
<section class="section dark on-dark" id="download" aria-labelledby="download-title">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="copy">
      <h2 id="download-title">Download for Mac</h2>
      {site.macAppReleased
        ? <p class="lede">Open it, drag ViewSwitcher to Applications, and it sets up OBS for you the first time. It keeps itself up to date.</p>
        : <p class="lede">The Mac app is in testing now. Follow it on GitHub and you'll get an email when it's ready to download.</p>}
      <Cta />
      <p class="small">Free and open source. Mac only for now.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="needs">
      <h3>What you need</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><b>A Mac</b></li>
        <li><b>OBS</b>, the free streaming app. ViewSwitcher sets it up for you.</li>
        <li><b>A camera</b>: a webcam, the Mac's own, or any camera OBS can see</li>
        <li>Optional: a phone, tablet or iPad to switch from</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <details class="dev">
      <summary>Developers: run it from source</summary>
      <div class="dev-body">
        <p>ViewSwitcher is open source. Views are plain HTML files in a folder you own, so a coding agent (or you) can write new ones; the library includes a skill that teaches agents the format. To run it today with <a href="https://bun.sh">Bun</a>:</p>
        <pre><code>git clone {github}.git
cd viewswitcher
bun install
bun run start</code></pre>
        <p>Then open <code>http://localhost:7420</code> and follow the <a href={`${github}#obs-setup-once`}>OBS setup</a> in the README.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .dark { background: var(--monitor); color: var(--on-monitor); }
  .dark h2, .dark h3 { color: var(--on-monitor); }
  .dark .lede { color: var(--on-monitor-2); }
  .dark :global(.btn-primary) { background: var(--on-monitor); color: var(--ink); }
  .dark :global(.btn-primary:hover) { background: #ffffff; }
  .grid { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: center; }
  @media (min-width: 60rem) { .grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 2.5rem 4rem; } .dev { grid-column: 1 / -1; } }
  .copy { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .small { font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--on-monitor-2); }
  .needs { display: grid; gap: 1rem; background: var(--monitor-2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem; }
  .needs ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; display: grid; gap: 0.55rem; color: var(--on-monitor-2); }
  .needs b { color: var(--on-monitor); font-weight: 600; }
  .dev { border-top: 1px solid #ffffff1f; padding-top: 1.25rem; color: var(--on-monitor-2); font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .dev summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--on-monitor); font-weight: 600; }
  .dev-body { display: grid; gap: 1rem; padding-top: 1rem; max-width: 44rem; }
  pre { margin: 0; background: var(--monitor-2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem; overflow-x: auto; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--on-monitor); }
  .dev code { color: var(--on-monitor); }
</style>
